## What to deliver

Build the dogsled sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — two running huskies leading at the right, a taut harness back to
a low sled on runners with a warm-parka musher at the left, and a little snow spray,
racing right across the 64x32 canvas, in the arctic palette on full transparency.
When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished
submission.
